    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "God’s Love and Faithfulness"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A psalm. A song for the Sabbath day."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "It is good to give thanks to the Lord,",
          "to sing praise to your name, Most High,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "to declare your faithful love in the morning",
          "and your faithfulness at night,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "with a ten-stringed harp",
          "and the music of a lyre."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For you have made me rejoice, Lord,",
          "by what you have done;",
          "I will shout for joy",
          "because of the works of your hands."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How magnificent are your works, Lord,",
          "how profound your thoughts!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A stupid person does not know,",
          "a fool does not understand this:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "though the wicked sprout like grass",
          "and all evildoers flourish,",
          "they will be eternally destroyed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But you, Lord, are exalted forever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For indeed, Lord, your enemies —",
          "indeed, your enemies will perish;",
          "all evildoers will be scattered."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have lifted up my horn",
          "like that of a wild ox;",
          "I have been anointed with the finest oil."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My eyes look at my enemies;",
          "when evildoers rise against me,",
          "my ears hear them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteous thrive like a palm tree",
          "and grow like a cedar tree in Lebanon."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Planted in the house of the Lord,",
          "they thrive in the courts of our God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will still bear fruit in old age,",
          "healthy and green,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "to declare, “The Lord is just;",
          "he is my rock,",
          "and there is no unrighteousness in him.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
